# Phase 3 R-B (Plan 03-02 Task 1): native-fixture-DLL landing zone.
#
# Utinni.CrtMatchPlugin.dll (built by Utinni.CrtMatchPlugin.vcxproj at the
# solution root) gets copied here at build time by the
# CopyNativeArtifactsForTests target in UtinniCoreDotNet.Tests.csproj
# alongside UtinniCore.dll. The fixture DLL itself is NOT checked in --
# this directory just gives PluginManagerLifecycleTests a stable known
# location to walk to from AppContext.BaseDirectory.
#
# This file exists so git tracks the empty directory.
